  message: "Done in PR #1959 (18e47b3960 + 9dbf7e2c30). Root cause: js_package_entry.probe_file used Path.with_suffix, which REPLACES the last dotted segment, so './Album.test-wrapper' + '.tsx' became Album.tsx. Fix: append each extension (Node's rule), then the TS twin only for a JS-extension specifier, then the directory index; core tests for package_entry added after CI flagged core-only coverage. CLOSURE EVIDENCE, production hypergumbo survey of nuclear on merged dev: packages/player/src/views/Album/Album.test.tsx:8 import from './Album.test-wrapper' -> packages/player/src/views/Album/Album.test-wrapper.tsx (was Album.tsx); the 7-repo re-audit has 0 relative edges disagreeing with Node's resolution order (3,877 checked)."  # a6fb
